        },
        {
          "text": "’Dini yi pe ’ba ti Siloa, yi eji sanduku aziza Yehova asikari ongu­lumuruniri, eri’i ripi kerubi pi ma eselia uruleruri; te ami Elini iri, Hofini pi Finehasi be, yi ovu ’daa sanduku aziza Mungunirini be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
